OL,3,GNEWSAPortrait of John Prescott unveiled
OL,4,
OL,5,FA new portrait of John Prescott has
OL,6,Fbeen welcomed into the Parliamentary
OL,7,FArt Collection.
OL,9,FThe Labour veteran died on 20 November
OL,10,F2024, aged 86. He was first elected as
OL,11,FMP for Hull East in 1970 and went on to
OL,12,Fhold the seat for almost 40 years.
OL,14,FThe new oil painting is the work of
OL,15,Fartist Lorna May Wadsworth, who is best
OL,16,Fknown for her paintings of national and
OL,17,Fpolitical figures.
OL,19,FIt was unveiled at a private event in
OL,20,FParliament with members of the Prescott
OL,21,Ffamily in attendance.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
